  "notes": "{増設|ぞうせつ} means adding more of something that already exists, not creating something entirely new. Used as both a noun and a suru-verb ({増設|ぞうせつ}する).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {設備|せつび}を{増設|ぞうせつ}する: add more equipment/facilities\n- メモリーを{増設|ぞうせつ}する: add more computer memory\n- {教室|きょうしつ}を{増設|ぞうせつ}する: add more classrooms\n- {路線|ろせん}を{増設|ぞうせつ}する: add more routes/lines\n- {駐車場|ちゅうしゃじょう}を{増設|ぞうせつ}する: add more parking\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {新設|しんせつ}: newly establishing something that didn't exist before\n- {増築|ぞうちく}: adding to a building (construction-specific)\n- {拡張|かくちょう}: expansion (broader, more abstract)",
